OL,3,GNEWSACat rescued by firefighters after
OL,4,Afive days in tree
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cat has been rescued by firefighters
OL,7,Fafter being stuck in a tree for five
OL,8,Fdays.
OL,10,FTilly climbed the tree near her home in
OL,11,FLytchett Matravers, Dorset, and her
OL,12,Fowners had tried everything to coax her
OL,13,Fdown.
OL,15,FTheir efforts included bringing in a
OL,16,Fcherry picker, but she was so high up,
OL,17,Fthey were unable to reach her.
OL,19,FFirefighters went to their aid on
OL,20,FTuesday, bringing Tilly safely back
OL,21,Fdown to earth.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
